flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[/Visitor opens /gallery, maybe with<br/>filters already in the address/]
  A --> B[Load the filter choices: styles,<br/>media, surfaces and years<br/>of every painting]
  B --> C{Logged<br/>in?}
  C -->|Yes| C1[Load their saved<br/>paintings so the<br/>hearts show] --> D
  C -->|No| D[GET /api/paintings with room,<br/>style, medium, surface,<br/>colour, years and sort]
  R1((B)) --> D
  D --> E[Keep only paintings on the<br/>wall and apply each filter]
  E --> F{Hide seen, and<br/>logged in?}
  F -->|Yes| F1[Leave out paintings<br/>this member<br/>has opened] --> P((A))
  F -->|No| P
